{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22297","headline":"赠苏少府 · 白居易","name":"赠苏少府","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"籍甚二十年，今日方款颜。\n相送嵩洛下，论心杯酒间。\n河亚嬾出入，府寮多闭关。\n苍发彼此老，白日寻常闲。\n朝从携手出，暮思联骑还。\n何当挈一榼，同宿龙门山。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22297.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22297","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}